# The immich-e2e-server container's filesystem, as upstream's e2e compose and server image
# lay it out. `<host> <container path>`; a host path under `state/` is the container's own
# (.enve/containers/immich-e2e-server/), any other is relative to the repository.
#
# compose volume `./test-assets:/test-assets`
e2e/test-assets  /test-assets
# the image's media location (an anonymous volume, renewed by `compose up`)
state/data       /data
# the image's build data (IMMICH_BUILD_DATA defaults to /build): geodata, plugins
state/build      /build
